# Pelican Architecture

- Articles: `content/articles/*.md` → `/articles/{slug}/`
- Pages: `content/pages/*.md` → `/pages/{slug}/` or configured SAVE_AS
- Site/nav copy: `data/site.yaml`, `data/categories.yaml`, `data/hub_sections.yaml`
- Partials under `theme/promptanatomy/templates/partials/` match names in `docs/COMPONENT_MAP.md`
- Pass explicit context to includes; avoid business logic in templates
- Draft posts: `status: draft` — exclude via Pelican `DEFAULT_METADATA` / readers
